Clutter.get_default_backend() is gone in mutter 51 (Clutter-51.gir no longer
has clutter_get_default_backend), so moving a tablet pen over the stage threw
on every motion event. The stage's context holds the same backend.
Not fixed upstream on the v18.0 branch as of 832aac5a.

diff --git a/src/components/tilingsystem/tilingManager.ts b/src/components/tilingsystem/tilingManager.ts
index 8a58a45..1f0108c 100644
--- a/src/components/tilingsystem/tilingManager.ts
+++ b/src/components/tilingsystem/tilingManager.ts
@@ -530,7 +530,7 @@ export class TilingManager {
                         const [x, y] = event.get_coords();
                         TouchPointer.get().onTouchEvent(x, y);
                         // Move the actual mouse cursor to match tablet position
-                        const seat = Clutter.get_default_backend().get_default_seat();
+                        const seat = global.stage.get_context().get_backend().get_default_seat();
                         seat.warp_pointer(x, y);
                     }
                 }
